cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the concept DOI (all versions) or the Zenodo record of the version you used."
type: software
title: "DuanSAW: An open-source solver for surface acoustic wave simulation"
abstract: >
  Piezoelectric coupled finite-element solver for the frequency-domain simulation of
  Surface Acoustic Wave (SAW) resonator unit cells. Version 2 is the Python package
  `sawsim`: Q9 (2D) and Hex27 (2.5D periodic slice) elements, Bloch periodic boundaries,
  complex-coordinate-stretched PML, intrinsic ZXZ Euler rotation of anisotropic crystals,
  Gmsh meshing, PARDISO/SuperLU direct solves with frequency-parallel Y11 sweeps, and
  point-by-point verification against an independent reference FEM solution.
  Versions 0.x are the MATLAB + Gmsh implementation.
authors:
  - family-names: Duan
    given-names: Shaoqing
repository-code: "https://github.com/Duane245/DuanSAW"
url: "https://github.com/Duane245/DuanSAW"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-12"
identifiers:
